      "Replication": "Disabled",
      "Description": "Runs DynamoFacadeLayout.",
      "Code": "cols = WallLength / TargetPanelW < 1 ? 1 : Math.Floor(WallLength / TargetPanelW);\nrows = WallHeight / TargetPanelH < 1 ? 1 : Math.Floor(WallHeight / TargetPanelH);\npanelCount = cols * rows;\npanelW = WallLength / cols;"
    },
